   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till V&#xE4;rldsbankens Global Road Safety Facility Trust Fund f&#xF6;r Afrika f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d till interventioner inom trafiks&#xE4;kerhetsomr&#xE5;det. Medel inom avtalet har &#xE4;ven finansierat sekondering av en trafiks&#xE4;kerhetsexpert till faciliteten, antal konsultuppdrag, samt medverkan i Facility Advisory Board.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to World Bank Global Road Safety Facility Trust Fund for Africa to support road safety interventions. Funds within this agreement has also financed a secondment to the Facitlity of a senior road safety expert, various conultant assignments, including participation on the Facility Advisory Board.</narrative>
